# Privacy Notice – Daily Number Guess

Last updated: 25 July 2026

This game is designed to be privacy-friendly.

## What data this game uses
The game stores limited data in your browser's local storage to:
- remember if you have already played today, and
- restore your board/results for the current day on refresh.

## What data is stored
Typical stored items:
- a date value (UK date) indicating last play day
- a local snapshot of your current/finished game board state for that day

## What we do **not** collect
We do not collect or store, on our servers:
- your name or email
- account information
- your guesses/history in a backend database
- precise location data

## Cookies and tracking
This game does not require cookies for core gameplay.  
Local storage is used for gameplay state on your device.

## Data retention
Stored gameplay data remains on your device until:
- it is overwritten by newer game data, or
- you clear your browser storage/site data.

## Your control
You can clear this data at any time by clearing browser site data/local storage for this site.

